{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747340/extras/7485c5de240288c3c9fb90ce7e33f909.avif?t=1761411093\" width=1000 height=246 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to POPWORLD, a reality TV show that promises to make the perfect pop group. 100 trainees from 31 countries will enter and the top 7 contestants will form a supergroup to bring light to the world.  <br> <br>Let's meet the contestants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747340/extras/f589d166392591c0934918f14da9afec.avif?t=1761411093\" width=1000 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ambitious, annoying girl who values her powerful singing voice above everything else. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mia enters Popworld hoping for a fresh new start, but the echoes of her past soon catch up to her and threaten to shatter her dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747340/extras/e063610a509a66ed602e81c3929ff173.avif?t=1761411093\" width=1000 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pragmatic boy who only feels confident when he's dancing on stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noah has felt invisible his whole life, a feeling that only amplified when his twin brother became a famous singer-songwriter. He navigates Popworld carefully but desperate to be seen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as both protagonists as you navigate new friendships and old enemies, but be careful, you're on camera! The choices you make will affect how others see you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the  dorms in point and click sections to find items and information that can help you on your journey.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way to the top in turn-based dance battles! You'll have to get through mean judges and fame-hungry contestants if you want to make it in this industry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring hand-drawn graphics, a pop music soundtrack and animated cutscenes.<br></p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3747340?t=1761411093","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747340/4effeb87a97ffa7655da59f7cf68f5dd6728d7cd/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761411093","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747340/6adcb7a6246aecd02241964f1cde58940e5132d1/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761411093","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747340/6adcb7a6246aecd02241964f1cde58940e5132d1/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761411093","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747340/extras/7485c5de240288c3c9fb90ce7e33f909.avif?t=1761411093\" width=1000 height=246 /></span><strong></strong><br><strong></strong><br><strong>STORY</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to POPWORLD, a reality TV show that promises to make the perfect pop group. 100 trainees from 31 countries will enter and the top 7 contestants will form a supergroup to bring light to the world.  <br> <br>Let's meet the contestants!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747340/extras/f589d166392591c0934918f14da9afec.avif?t=1761411093\" width=1000 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An ambitious, annoying girl who values her powerful singing voice above everything else. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mia enters Popworld hoping for a fresh new start, but the echoes of her past soon catch up to her and threaten to shatter her dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747340/extras/e063610a509a66ed602e81c3929ff173.avif?t=1761411093\" width=1000 height=270 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A pragmatic boy who only feels confident when he's dancing on stage.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Noah has felt invisible his whole life, a feeling that only amplified when his twin brother became a famous singer-songwriter. He navigates Popworld carefully but desperate to be seen. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play as both protagonists as you navigate new friendships and old enemies, but be careful, you're on camera! The choices you make will affect how others see you.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the  dorms in point and click sections to find items and information that can help you on your journey.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way to the top in turn-based dance battles! You'll have to get through mean judges and fame-hungry contestants if you want to make it in this industry.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring hand-drawn graphics, a pop music soundtrack and animated cutscenes.<br></p></li></ul>","developers":["Rory Carson"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3747340